                                <li>• <strong>Doxygen + AST Pipeline:</strong> Extract entities (classes, functions) and relationships</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Structural & Behavioral Graphs:</strong> UML-inspired dual-level analysis</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Philosophy Metadata:</strong> Tag packages with architectural context</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Workflow Extraction:</strong> Trace execution paths and call sequences</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-cyan-600/25">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Architectural Intelligence (C# ASP.NET Core)</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>API Gateway:</strong> Enterprise-grade REST endpoints for graph queries</li>
                                <li>• <strong>MCP Host (McpController):</strong> JSON-RPC 2.0 protocol for AI agents</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Refactoring Service:</strong> Active detection of God Classes and violations</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Python Bridge:</strong> IGraphProvider service consuming Python output</li>
                            </ul>
